        "text_dNhFj4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Epigenetic age testing</strong> involves assessing the biological age of your cells, effectively revealing the pace of your body’s aging process. It offers valuable insights into your overall health, allowing for more accurate and personalized preventive care strategies. Our,<strong> </strong>at-home epigenetic age test tells you how old you <em>really</em> are from a biological standpoint, and analyzes how fast or slow your body is <strong>currently aging</strong> on a cellular level.</p><p>In partnership with <strong>Tru Diagnostics</strong>, we’re proud to present an exclusive at home Epigenetic age Testing kit. This innovative test provides an assessment of your biological age, offering a deep dive into the pacing of cellular aging. </p><p>Our kit is the perfect choice for <strong>anti-aging </strong>aficionados. It offers a holistic view of your baseline aging metrics besides a detailed analysis of specific <strong>biomarkers related to aging.</strong></p><p>With convenience in mind, this is a dry blood sample collection kit which can be performed remotely, and <strong>AIWO</strong> will ensure a smooth facilitation of delivery from India to the TruDiagnostic laboratory in the USA, ensuring hassle free wellness tracking.</p>",
            "number_of_lines_shown": "none",
            "read_more_label": "Read more",
            "see_less_label": "See less"
          }
